~ greeting
friend: Hey. You made it. [#shot=wide] [ID:s1_001]
friend: Well? [#timed=6, #shot=wide] [ID:s1_002]
- Good to see you. [#opt=kind]
	do Story.choose("greeting", "kind")
	do Story.remember("was_kind", true, "Your friend will remember that.")
	friend: Same. Come in. [ID:s1_003]
- Let us get this over with. [#opt=cold]
	do Story.choose("greeting", "cold")
	friend: Right. Okay. [ID:s1_004]
- ... [#silence, #opt=silent]
	do Story.choose("greeting", "silent")
	friend: Not a talker today. [ID:s1_005]
